{
  "name": "codejson-action-e2e",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Sandbox repository used to end-to-end test the automated code.json generator",
  "longDescription": "This repository serves as a disposable sandbox environment designed for comprehensive end-to-end testing of the automated code.json generator. It allows developers and maintainers to validate every change made to the generator against a live GitHub repository before deployment. The workflow executes the generator across various modes and scenarios, ensuring that the tool accurately performs its intended functions. This rigorous validation process maintains the reliability and trustworthiness of the code. Ultimately, this sandbox ensures that the critical code.json inventory files remain current and accurate for compliance requirements.",
